 drivers/iio/health/Kconfig    |  18 ++
 drivers/iio/health/Makefile   |   1 +
 drivers/iio/health/max86150.c | 533 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 3 files changed, 552 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 drivers/iio/health/max86150.c

